00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.160
Saigo-san.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:56.040
Sir!

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:57.890
Yes.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:00.120
If you are looking for a fight, please find Tako.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.320
We're sorry!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.330
Excuse us!

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.690
That scared the shit out of me.

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:11.080
No one around here can beat Saigo-san.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.840
Hey, look at that.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:13.400
Huh?

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.600
Is that guy shivering?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.820
Koushi-dono...

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:33.560
Inuzuka-kun!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.350
Did that hurt?

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:36.380
Not really.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:37.980
Listen,

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:39.960
do our homework for us.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.420
Huh? Got something to say?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:44.700
No...

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:49.440
See ya.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.670
I'm counting on you.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.990
Right? Didn't I tell you?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.160
What a chicken.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.140
I wonder which idiot said that he's strong?

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:06.150
Why are you doing those guys' homework?

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:14.090
You can't pass the law exam if you don't do other people's homework.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.720
I see!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.420
It's for the sake of fulfilling your dream, right?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.020
As I thought!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:24.290
Koushi-dono haven't changed a bit since then.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:32.680
Hmm?

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.220
Wh... When did you...?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:36.690
It's a wife's duty.

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.040
Who is my wife!?

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:40.050
Allow me to join you in the bath.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.000
Don't be embarrassed...

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.220
I have been waiting for you.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:58.700
Let us have the courtship of love! Please!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:03.600
Is someone like me unable to satisfy someone as strong as Koushi-dono...?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.360
Koushi is strong?

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:07.620
That's an overstatement.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:08.220
Huh?

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.850
He is weak.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.010
Not only his body, but also his heart.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.020
Though his big mouth is better than anyone's.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:18.890
He's a coward who can do nothing but running away in front of violence.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:20.210
That can't be true!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.620
That's the truth.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.920
He has been a spineless wimp ever since he gave up on martial arts.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:28.340
Koushi-dono gave up on martial arts?

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.170
Good morning!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.050
Hey, hey, Koushi-dono.

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.530
Why did you give up on martial arts?

00:14:36.280 --> 00:14:39.450
Even though you trained so hard back then.

00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:40.270
Why?

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:42.590
It's happening again.

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.630
What exactly happened back then?

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.490
