00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.230
Why did I give up on martial arts?

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.710
Ah. Look at that!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.540
Let's go help him!

00:14:58.070 --> 00:14:59.170
Ho...

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.620
My body froze...

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.350
I can't move...

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.260
Koushi-dono?

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:06.800
I'll be late.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:07.620
Huh?

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.590
