00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:10.940
No way!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:16.120
I must study hard in order to punish bigger criminals in the future.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.580
I don't have to bother myself with trivial matters like that.

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:22.780
Trivial... matters...

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:29.370
Saving me from those bullies back then...

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.230
Was it also just a trivial matter?

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:36.500
It may be something insignificant to you, Koushi-dono...

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:44.260
But your strong and gentle figure back then, appeared very tall and powerful to me.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:50.820
At times when I was sad or in pain, your shadow was my encouragement.

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:54.150
And then, even now, even now...

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:59.580
I still have high hopes for you, I still believe in you...

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.030
