00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:14.140
Why are you squeezing your right hand?

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:19.200
Are you suppressing yourself in your heart?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.400
That's right.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.940
I'm cowardly and afraid.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.270
I have been suppressing my true self.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.980
Hey, ugly, stop that.

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.090
