00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.420
Article 208 of the criminal law, battery!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.440
Those who cause bodily harm to others may be sentenced to ten years of imprisonment and a fine of ¥300000.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:46.390
Article 249 of the criminal law, harassment!

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:48.930
Article 222 of the criminal law, extortion!

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.660
You guys have violated them all!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:53.800
The law and I are just, and you guys are wrong!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.300
That was so cool~!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.630
I did it.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:16:59.420
