00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.460
Wha...!?

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.350
What's with this situation...?

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.330
There is no way I can fight...

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.280
I gave up on martial arts...

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:20.260
Though I can't remember the reason, but I did give up.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.250
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.980
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:30.400
This voice, these words... I think I've heard them before...

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:34.020
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:37.250
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:41.740
I remember now...

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.520
Bring it on!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.850
It happened once before.

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.160
Let's beat him!

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.800
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.530
I really did meet her.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.100
I tried to save her from the bullies.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.930
The result of trying to act cool like this time was...

00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:59.010
This guy is so weak.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.200
Eat this.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.870
Please avenge me, Koushi-dono!

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.290
Don't look at my pee-pee!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.740
Since then, I have developed a phobia for quarrels.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.410
I gave up on martial arts.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.580
Do your best, Koushi-dono!

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:19.850
It's impossible!

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:22.840
That dazzling appearance...

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:23.490
Momoko's Vision

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.790
It's just like back then...

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:24.360
Momoko's Vision

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:25.250
Momoko's Vision

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:26.630
Reality

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.300
Did you forget that I was beat into a pulp?

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:27.490
Reality

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:28.380
Reality

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.200
Reality

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:32.630
I'm sure her brain has nothing but muscles.

